1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Good evening, everyone.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Did anyone feed the dog?

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[moaning]

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The train is running late again.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Where did you put the map?

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
It was on the kitchen table.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Oh, crap. Damn it.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Look, the lake is frozen.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Can we stop for hot chocolate?

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
[kissing]

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Tell me the story about the lighthouse.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Remember to call your aunt.
